 * ============================================================================
 *
 * Preserves the frozen P8-P12 NHL model:
 *
 * Q:X   NHL projection / probability / EV
 * Z:AD  NHL decision + trend signals
 * AG    NHL Model Confidence
 *
 * P15 now owns:
